# armour/shared/pauldron_slab3_r: the medium SLAB pauldron on the right shoulder (slab.3; FORGE-SHOULDERS, STYLE_P2 28.3).
# one square hammered plate, hard corners, a row of rivets along its foot (WROUGHT, iron): boxy and heavy.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`). Finish regions: R the slab's top edge, G the middle rivet, N the rivet row's gaps, P the plane.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Redrawn by BODY i2 mass2.py (a boxy spaulder on the shoulder, not a plank; re-run, never hand-edit
# the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron slab.3
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

view D key rest origin 4 2 layer headwear
|vvvvvvvv
|vyzyyxwv
|vyyyxxwv
|.vyxxxwv
|..vvvvv.
regions
